        "section_caption": "",
        "section_style_heading": "Swimsuit Inserts & Breast Forms",
        "section_heading": "Inspired by Expertise",
        "section_text": "<p>With 15 years in the swimwear industry, Angela Kornas was all too familiar with the shortcomings of traditional swimsuit inserts. Her experience—from designing supportive swimwear to developing high-performance Olympic racing suits—highlighted a problem women had been putting up with for decades: flimsy inserts that shifted, folded, lost their shape, and simply weren’t designed with real women in mind.</p><p>Frustrated by the lack of innovation, Angela channeled her expertise into creating Honey Cloudz and rethinking what was possible. What began with better swimsuit inserts has since expanded to include lightweight breast forms and balancing solutions for women after breast surgery—all thoughtfully designed to deliver comfort, function, and confidence in and out of the water.</p><p>Today, Honey Cloudz helps women find the shape, balance, coverage, or lift they’re looking for without compromising on comfort—because every woman deserves to feel supported in her swimsuit. </p>",
        "custom_html": "",
        "button_text": "Shop Now",
        "button_link": "",
        "image_position": "left",
        "section_padding_top": 65,
        "section_padding_bottom": 30,
        "section_mob_padding_top": 40,
        "section_mob_padding_bottom": 0,
        "custom_class": "custom-class"
      }
    },
    "benefit_accordion_iw_KwCeYf": {
      "type": "benefit-accordion-iw",
      "blocks": {
        "benefit_NHEVjq": {
          "type": "benefit",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I insert the Honey Cloudz bra inserts into my swimsuit?",
            "content": "<p>Inserting Honey Cloudz bra inserts or breast forms into your swimsuit is easy! Simply slide them into the built-in pockets of your swimsuit top. <br/><br/><strong>For inserts:</strong> if your swimsuit doesn’t have pockets, no worries—our inserts are non-slip and can be worn directly against your skin for a secure fit. Make sure to position them as desired for the best shape and coverage.<br/><br/><strong>For breast forms</strong>: they are best worn inside pocketed swimsuits for extra stability.</p>"
          }
        },
        "benefit_nGWKYJ": {
          "type": "benefit",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Are Honey Cloudz really water-safe?",
            "content": "<p>Absolutely! All Honey Cloudz inserts and breast forms are designed to be water-safe, meaning they’re perfect for swimming, lounging by the pool, or any water activity. </p><p>Made from chlorine-safe materials, these inserts and breast forms stay lightweight and in place.</p>"
